; A VisibleOnScreenEnabler3D with an aabb that is not the default, for the one variable no other golden
; moves: its editor gizmo, which Godot draws as the one of its base class VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D. The
; previewer draws the edges and axes faint for every node and the fill for the selected one
; (ADR-0056), so only a golden with `gizmos: true` has them. A small box sits at two opposite corners
; of the aabb to frame the whole gizmo.
